#: ../../library/zlib.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`zlib` --- zlib compression & decompression"
msgstr ":mod:`zlib` --- zlib kompresija i dekompresija"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module allows compression and decompression of binary data with the "
"`DEFLATE algorithm <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE>`_ (commonly used "
"in the zlib library and gzip archiver)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul omogućuje kompresiju i dekompresiju binarnih podataka pomoću "
"`DEFLATE algoritma <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE>`_ (uobičajeno "
"korištenog u zlib biblioteci i gzip arhivaru)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:11
msgid ""
"Prefer to use :class:`deflate.DeflateIO` instead of the functions in this "
"module as it provides a streaming interface to compression and decompression"
" which is convenient and more memory efficient when working with reading or "
"writing compressed data to a file, socket, or stream."
msgstr ""
"Preferirajte korištenje :class:`deflate.DeflateIO` umjesto funkcija iz ovog "
"modula jer pruža tokovno sučelje za kompresiju i dekompresiju koje je "
"pogodno i memorijski učinkovitije pri radu s čitanjem ili pisanjem "
"komprimiranih podataka u datoteku, utičnicu ili tok."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:16
msgid "**Availability:**"
msgstr "**Dostupnost:**"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:18
msgid ""
"This module is **not included on the OpenMV Cam** by default, as it "
"duplicates functionality already provided by the :mod:`deflate <deflate>` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul **nije uključen na OpenMV Cam-u** prema zadanim postavkama jer "
"duplicira funkcionalnost koju već pruža modul :mod:`deflate <deflate>`\\ ."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:22
msgid ""
"A copy can be installed (or frozen into custom firmware) from "
":term:`micropython-lib` (`source "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython-lib/blob/master/python-"
"stdlib/zlib/zlib.py>`_). See :ref:`packages` for more information. This "
"documentation describes that module."
msgstr ""
"Kopija se može instalirati (ili zamrznuti u prilagođeni ugrađeni program "
"(firmware)) iz :term:`micropython-lib` (\\ `izvor "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython-lib/blob/master/python-"
"stdlib/zlib/zlib.py>`_\\ ). Pogledajte :ref:`packages` za više informacija. "
"Ova dokumentacija opisuje taj modul."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:26
msgid ""
"It relies on the built-in :mod:`deflate <deflate>` module, which is present "
"on all OpenMV Cams."
msgstr ""
"Oslanja se na ugrađeni modul :mod:`deflate <deflate>`\\ , koji je prisutan "
"na svim OpenMV Cam-ovima."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:29
msgid ""
"Compression is only available if compression is available in the built-in "
":mod:`deflate <deflate>` module -- that is, not on the STM32-based OpenMV "
"Cams (see its availability note above)."
msgstr ""
"Kompresija je dostupna samo ako je kompresija dostupna u ugrađenom modulu "
":mod:`deflate <deflate>` -- to jest, ne na OpenMV Cam-ovima temeljenima na "
"STM32 (pogledajte napomenu o dostupnosti iznad)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:34
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:38
msgid "Decompresses *data* into a bytes object."
msgstr "Dekomprimira *data* u bytes objekt."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:40
msgid ""
"The *wbits* parameter works the same way as for :meth:`zlib.compress` with "
"the following additional valid values:"
msgstr ""
"Parametar *wbits* radi na isti način kao za :meth:`zlib.compress` uz "
"sljedeće dodatne valjane vrijednosti:"

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:43
msgid ""
"``0``: Automatically determine the window size from the zlib header (*data* "
"must be in zlib format)."
msgstr ""
"``0``\\ : Automatski određuje veličinu prozora iz zlib zaglavlja (\\ *data* "
"mora biti u zlib formatu)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:45
msgid "``35`` to ``47``: Auto-detect either the zlib or gzip format."
msgstr "``35`` do ``47``\\ : Automatski prepoznaje zlib ili gzip format."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:47
msgid ""
"As for :meth:`zlib.compress`, see the :mod:`CPython documentation for zlib "
"<python:zlib>` for more information about the *wbits* parameter. As for "
":meth:`zlib.compress`, MicroPython also supports smaller window sizes than "
"CPython. See more :ref:`MicroPython-specific details <deflate_wbits>` in the"
" :mod:`deflate <deflate>` module documentation."
msgstr ""
"Kao i za :meth:`zlib.compress`\\ , pogledajte :mod:`CPython dokumentaciju za"
" zlib <python:zlib>` za više informacija o parametru *wbits*\\ . Kao i za "
":meth:`zlib.compress`\\ , MicroPython također podržava manje veličine "
"prozora od CPythona. Pogledajte više :ref:`pojedinosti specifičnih za "
"MicroPython <deflate_wbits>` u dokumentaciji modula :mod:`deflate "
"<deflate>`\\ ."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:53
msgid ""
"If the data to be decompressed requires a larger window size, it will fail "
"during decompression."
msgstr ""
"Ako podaci koji se dekomprimiraju zahtijevaju veću veličinu prozora, "
"dekompresija će propasti."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:58
msgid "Compresses *data* into a bytes object."
msgstr "Komprimira *data* u bytes objekt."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:60
msgid ""
"*wbits* allows you to configure the DEFLATE dictionary window size and the "
"output format. The window size allows you to trade-off memory usage for "
"compression level. A larger window size will allow the compressor to "
"reference fragments further back in the input. The output formats are "
"\"raw\" DEFLATE (no header/footer), zlib, and gzip, where the latter two "
"include a header and checksum."
msgstr ""
"*wbits* vam omogućuje konfiguriranje veličine prozora DEFLATE rječnika i "
"izlaznog formata. Veličina prozora omogućuje vam kompromis između upotrebe "
"memorije i razine kompresije. Veća veličina prozora omogućit će kompresoru "
"da referencira fragmente dalje unatrag u ulazu. Izlazni formati su "
"\"sirovi\" DEFLATE (bez zaglavlja/podnožja), zlib i gzip, pri čemu "
"posljednja dva uključuju zaglavlje i kontrolni zbroj."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:67
msgid ""
"The low four bits of the absolute value of *wbits* set the base-2 logarithm "
"of the DEFLATE dictionary window size. So for example, ``wbits=10``, "
"``wbits=-10``, and ``wbits=26`` all set the window size to 1024 bytes. Valid"
" window sizes are ``5`` to ``15`` inclusive (corresponding to 32 to 32k "
"bytes)."
msgstr ""
"Donja četiri bita apsolutne vrijednosti *wbits* postavljaju logaritam po "
"bazi 2 veličine prozora DEFLATE rječnika. Tako, na primjer, ``wbits=10``\\ ,"
" ``wbits=-10`` i ``wbits=26`` svi postavljaju veličinu prozora na 1024 "
"bajta. Valjane veličine prozora su ``5`` do ``15`` uključivo (što odgovara "
"32 do 32k bajtova)."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:72
msgid ""
"Negative values of *wbits* between ``-5`` and ``-15`` correspond to \"raw\" "
"output mode, positive values between ``5`` and ``15`` correspond to zlib "
"output mode, and positive values between ``21`` and ``31`` correspond to "
"gzip output mode."
msgstr ""
"Negativne vrijednosti *wbits* između ``-5`` i ``-15`` odgovaraju \"sirovom\""
" izlaznom načinu, pozitivne vrijednosti između ``5`` i ``15`` odgovaraju "
"zlib izlaznom načinu, a pozitivne vrijednosti između ``21`` i ``31`` "
"odgovaraju gzip izlaznom načinu."

#: ../../library/zlib.rst:77
msgid ""
"See the :mod:`CPython documentation for zlib <python:zlib>` for more "
"information about the *wbits* parameter. Note that MicroPython allows for "
"smaller window sizes, which is useful when memory is constrained while still"
" achieving a reasonable level of compression. It also speeds up the "
"compressor. See more :ref:`MicroPython-specific details <deflate_wbits>` in "
"the :mod:`deflate <deflate>` module documentation."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte :mod:`CPython dokumentaciju za zlib <python:zlib>` za više "
"informacija o parametru *wbits*\\ . Imajte na umu da MicroPython dopušta "
"manje veličine prozora, što je korisno kada je memorija ograničena, a "
"istovremeno se postiže razumna razina kompresije. Također ubrzava kompresor."
" Pogledajte više :ref:`pojedinosti specifičnih za MicroPython "
"<deflate_wbits>` u dokumentaciji modula :mod:`deflate <deflate>`\\ ."
